{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11224050","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11224050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1122405001:1":{"text":"또 널 노리고 온 것 같아, 실버 빅.","source_cn":"又是冲着你来的，银喙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33A01CB2EA54E72D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1122405002:1":{"text":"...돈을 가지고 도망가려고 했다는 말이 사실이야?","source_cn":"……他们说你准备卷钱跑路，是真的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CBD42FAAB7B9211","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1122405003:1":{"text":"너까지 나를 의심하는 거야?! 와일더!","source_cn":"连你也要怀疑我吗？！烈爪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33EED4362A44683C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1122405004:1":{"text":"내가 널 의심하고 싶은 게 아니야! 하지만 기지를 세우고 난 뒤부터 이런 사람들이 몇 번이나 찾아왔었잖아!","source_cn":"不是我想怀疑你！可是自从建立了基地，这样的人来了好几拨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC59165F72E80E1FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1122405005:1":{"text":"게다가 네가 돈을 많이 뗀 건 사실이고. 그레이혼도 그것 때문에 화가 나서 가버린 거잖아! 우리에겐 해명이 필요해!","source_cn":"而且你确实抽成了不少钱，老憨也气不过走了！我们需要一个解释！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAACFDF694CC7D17D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1122405006:1":{"text":"...좋아. 그들이 왔을 때 기지의 돈을 세고 있었다는 건 인정할게.","source_cn":"……好吧。我承认，他们来的时候，我是在清点基地里的钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1F3BE6FBD4F5D0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1122405007:1":{"text":"하지만 그건 내가 주문한 물건이 이제 곧 도착할 거라 물건값을 지불하기 위해서 그랬던 거였어!","source_cn":"但那是因为我订了一批货，马上就要送来了，我得准备好货款！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66EBF448004CC446","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1122405008:1":{"text":"기지의 총기, 화약, 물자, 전부 내가 책임지고 주문한 것들이니까. 그리고 그 나쁜 녀석들이 말했던 빚은 완전히 헛소리야!","source_cn":"基地里的枪支、火药、物资，全部都是我负责订购的。至于那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1357724A506423FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1122405009:1":{"text":"그들이 밖에서 외상을 하는 바람에 상인들이 경호원을 데리고 찾아와서 억지로 내 손에서 돈을 빼앗아간 것 뿐이라고!","source_cn":"他们在外面赊了那么多账，是那些商人带着打手找上门，硬生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E2CD4731CD1E460","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1122405010:1":{"text":"난 잠시 피해있었던 것뿐인데 돌아와 보니 나를 잡아먹으려는 듯이 덤비지 않겠어? 게다가 내가 그 녀석들의 돈을 가지고 갔다고 모함하면서 말이야! 나야말로 억울하다고!","source_cn":"我不过出去避避风头，结果回来就看见他们一副要生吞活剥了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9E9D8E119FFF2A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1122405011:1":{"text":"그럼 애버트에게 돈은 왜 준 거야?","source_cn":"那你为什么要给艾伯特钱？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ED9AB502444B6BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1122405012:1":{"text":"전에 내게 돈을 빌려줬던 건 맞아. 내가 좀 더 얹어서 준 건 이자이기도, 그 일을 무마시키고 싶어서이기도 해.","source_cn":"他以前确实借过我钱。我多给了一些，算是利息，也是息事宁人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC94AAEDE3D388C93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1122405013:1":{"text":"...<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 넌 어떻게 생각해?","source_cn":"……<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7C530F8A39B9C47A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 넌 어떻게 생각해?","female":"...<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 넌 어떻게 생각해?","variant_male_record_index":"127081","variant_female_record_index":"127082","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1122405013":{"text":"...<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 넌 어떻게 생각해?","source_cn":"……<style=stress><player_name></style>，你觉得呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7C530F8A39B9C47A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 넌 어떻게 생각해?","female":"...<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 넌 어떻게 생각해?","variant_male_record_index":"127081","variant_female_record_index":"127082","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1122405014:1":{"text":"역시 네가 사리에 밝네, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","source_cn":"还是你明事理，<style=stress><playe...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4EDDFD810EF4DC1F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"역시 네가 사리에 밝네, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","female":"역시 네가 사리에 밝네, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","variant_male_record_index":"127083","variant_female_record_index":"127084","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1122405016:1":{"text":"그렇다면... 나도 믿을게.","source_cn":"既然如此……我也相信你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC81BCF9E64F92988","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1122405017:1":{"text":"좋아. 자, 이제부터 도적을 소탕하고 상단의 물건을 되찾을 준비를 해야 해.","source_cn":"很好。我们该开始准备清除盗匪，找回商队货物的事了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AF96840B63C23A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1122405018:1":{"text":"와일더가 도적 영지의 위치와 그들 내부의 수비병 상황을 파악했어.","source_cn":"烈爪已经确认了盗匪营地的位置，还有他们内部的守卫情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E68790C80EE9546","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1122405019:1":{"text":"규칙에 따르면 지금이 바로 경비가 허술할 때야. 어서 서둘러서 가도록 해.","source_cn":"按照规律，现在就是他们守卫最松懈的时候。你们两个抓紧时...","stat